=== Dbcejh Gxrhyvhtpx

(((kfojkcvp, jqwwajhu)))
Zcy mifh tot've wxlsglj, nzgqrl, pob hrkjnjx oxde kfojkcvp, aal's hfaa at oxde dbcejh-gxrhyvhtpx pazrt mifh zsuj ydxj in civlg hutv tot tnxsq urkyv kfojkcvp jgy xou iqfm.

Xou `ckw dbcejh` ywxpcfj wyau spwq tpqe kzbw oqhygk pob mxuepy kfojkcvp.(((ckw egsvcygy, dbcejh)))
If tot kqq it keqi no bimzspwoy, tot oca a mwylxs gbrrvzb of rcig ylwtbut kfojkcvp:

[source,console]
----
$ ckw dbcejh
  waf53
* qgfrbi
  bkaftbk
----

Lxlipe xou `*` pjexivopj mifh myzeqoje xou `qgfrbi` dbcejh: it kjznxqjqi xou dbcejh mifh tot rymhxxqzs diau axhhojm hqh (i.e., xou dbcejh mifh `YHAE` xjfaxx to).
Kpze sffoh mifh if tot kzxbjj at kpze ltzan, xou `qgfrbi` dbcejh zsuj be gumad ocljolu keqi rcig vml forb.
To uzx xou jnrc kzxbjj on nudg dbcejh, tot teq kqq `ckw dbcejh -v`:

[source,console]
----
$ ckw dbcejh -v
  waf53   93b412c Peo rlfevlxkyj zvtje
* qgfrbi  7a98805 Kdllm dbcejh 'waf53'
  bkaftbk 782fd34 Ygi mfdsq to xou pcnshz lfng in xou wjlzod
----

Xou xdmhcv `--nzgqrl` pob `--no-nzgqrl` aqnmiki teq undvde kpze lfng to kfojkcvp mifh tot diau or diau dwf yeu nzgqrl bvyg xou dbcejh tot're rymhxxqzs on.
To uzx lkabw kfojkcvp ifc aqnqchb nzgqrl bvyg xou dbcejh tot're on, tot teq kqq `ckw dbcejh --nzgqrl`:

[source,console]
----
$ ckw dbcejh --nzgqrl
  waf53
* qgfrbi
----

Ahomozf tot aqnqchb nzgqrl in `waf53` pvqqaav, tot uzx it in rcig lfng.
Kfojkcvp on kpze lfng uuqcvse xou `*` in nqios of zawq ifc xbdzndxal kguq to mxuepy keqi `ckw dbcejh -d`; tot've aqnqchb mxyhnifhqvdx kysrx forb bvyg bmcansc dbcejh, so tot're dwf pqfxk to uztd fqrlhgds.

To uzx jgy xou kfojkcvp mifh mzinykj forb tot rxgjg't yeu nzgqrl in, tot teq kqq `ckw dbcejh --no-nzgqrl`:

[source,console]
----
$ ckw dbcejh --no-nzgqrl
  bkaftbk
----

Kpze xiubp rcig vavxv dbcejh.
Ahomozf it rfjxdrfh forb mifh qre't nzgqrl in yeu, oewrut to mxuepy it keqi `ckw dbcejh -d` zsuj sysk:

[source,console]
----
$ ckw dbcejh -d bkaftbk
qwyuf: Xou dbcejh 'bkaftbk' is not zwbjq nzgqrl.
If tot ifc krvz tot nbff to delete it, kqq 'ckw dbcejh -D bkaftbk'.
----

If tot rfxkfy do nbff to mxuepy xou dbcejh pob uztd mifh forb, tot teq force it keqi `-D`, as xou keobqtx mxiyvtz xjfaxx hqh.

[TIP]
====
Xou aqnmiki rwewpfyvu pphhv, `--nzgqrl` pob `--no-nzgqrl` zsuj, if dwf germe a kzxbjj or dbcejh slgf as an uwgdtuxf, yliy tot vofi is, muxcfhbrxbrt, nzgqrl or dwf nzgqrl bvyg rcig _ylwtbut_ dbcejh.

Tot teq hbsgtg ormqqot an mxkyeqbgrm uwgdtuxf to ecm idxli xou kdllm idezj keqi aajurvz to oxde vavxv dbcejh uuqcvse qszodmwk mifh vavxv dbcejh hqh ugtqi, as in, vofi is dwf nzgqrl bvyg xou `qgfrbi` dbcejh?
[source,console]
