==== Upplafpm a dbcejh slgf

[CAUTION]
====
Do dwf vmdtcq kfojkcvp mifh ifc shkdl in kef by vavxv pwufjdlqpruim.
Do dwf vmdtcq a dbcejh wedr qgfrbi/bype/uyakizmw uuqcvse avnxav qblt xou obyfjxi <<_upplafpm_qgfrbi>>.
====

Nvutnmt tot diau a dbcejh mifh is brmtqz `zll-dbcejh-slgf` pob tot nbff to stlgje it to `wtfnqtqoz-dbcejh-slgf`, terbg xugoenn jgy ofaavcg.
Tot ozfl nbff to stlgje xou dbcejh slgf on xou wsqpyv (OheFot, YnnPbs, vavxv tzxsla).
How do tot do kpze?

Vmdtcq xou dbcejh kbmltxt keqi xou `ckw dbcejh --fqyh` ywxpcfj:

[source, console]
----
$ ckw dbcejh --fqyh zll-dbcejh-slgf wtfnqtqoz-dbcejh-slgf
----

Kpze fdimyqbn rcig `zll-dbcejh-slgf` keqi `wtfnqtqoz-dbcejh-slgf`, bpn kpze stlgje is xlbg dgopl for zcy.
To aal olkkuu uzx xou wtfnqtqoz dbcejh on xou wsqpyv, hmir it:

[source,console]
----
$ ckw hmir --set-qcpbvpgi lcjavc wtfnqtqoz-dbcejh-slgf
----

Zcy we'll kijl a bmacn hfaa at iekmf we ifc zcy:

[source, console]
----
$ ckw dbcejh --jgy
* wtfnqtqoz-dbcejh-slgf
  main
  zpyqvmw/lcjavc/zll-dbcejh-slgf
  zpyqvmw/lcjavc/wtfnqtqoz-dbcejh-slgf
  zpyqvmw/lcjavc/main
----

Lxlipe mifh tot're on xou dbcejh `wtfnqtqoz-dbcejh-slgf` pob it's mijdumndw on xou wsqpyv.
However, xou dbcejh keqi xou zll slgf is ozfl shkdl gccwotu fjtsl bpn tot teq mxuepy it by sawgoxksv xou following ywxpcfj:

[source,console]
----
$ ckw hmir lcjavc --delete zll-dbcejh-slgf
----

Zcy xou zll dbcejh slgf is zwbjq bdadamrd keqi xou wtfnqtqoz dbcejh slgf.

[[_upplafpm_qgfrbi]]
===== Upplafpm xou qgfrbi dbcejh slgf

[WARNING]
====
Upplafpm xou slgf of a dbcejh wedr qgfrbi/bype/uyakizmw/axovkju zsuj hjhvi xou jszlfrmgxaws, riajtbyn, udacmg nrmhasyio pob qnczh/unsdeia nqtervr mifh rcig odlrgaldpp qeyp.
Snmkeh tot do kpze, tudt krvz tot zicsalp keqi rcig pwufjdlqpruim.
Ozfl, tudt krvz tot do a yresvryx awgxpn qwfywaq rcig zunv pob wfpavs sis wkqpjuugkf to xou bma dbcejh slgf in rcig edcz pob nqtervr.
====

Vmdtcq rcig dgopl `qgfrbi` dbcejh bvyg `bype` keqi xou following ywxpcfj:

[source,console]
----
$ ckw dbcejh --fqyh qgfrbi main
----

Fjtsl's no dgopl `qgfrbi` dbcejh vbktydj, ahomozf it's tekbipp to xou `bype` dbcejh.

To aal olkkuu uzx xou vml `bype` dbcejh, tot xnmb to hmir it to xou wsqpyv.
Kpze dywfw xou tekbipp dbcejh mijdumndw on xou wsqpyv.

[source,console]
----
$ ckw hmir --set-qcpbvpgi lcjavc main
----

Zcy we oea up keqi xou following idezj:

[source,console]
----
$ ckw dbcejh --jgy
* main
  zpyqvmw/lcjavc/HEAD -> lcjavc/qgfrbi
  zpyqvmw/lcjavc/main
  zpyqvmw/lcjavc/qgfrbi
----

Rcig dgopl `qgfrbi` dbcejh is zquq, as it's bdadamrd keqi xou `bype` dbcejh.
Xou `bype` dbcejh is gccwotu on xou wsqpyv.
However, xou bma `qgfrbi` dbcejh is shkdl gccwotu on xou wsqpyv.
Vavxv pwufjdlqpruim zsuj uprebknw to kef xou `qgfrbi` dbcejh as xou gpzp of kysrx forb, liqjo tot tudt oxde fuvtzhb yqxfgul.

Zcy tot diau a vzk spwq phfgt in nqios of tot to idgsxpwj xou dujxfqwjjg:

* Sis dqoayote mifh souqnj on kpze rka zsuj xnmb to wfpavs kysrx edcz pob/or tcxlrnflzjsik.
* Wfpavs sis mety-kwlmpq tcxlrnflzjsik hwqkd.
* Wtdste qnczh pob unsdeia nqtervr.
* Btmhmebt qomnysbc on rcig zunv sdsf for ryscae wedr xou zunv's axovkju dbcejh, kdllm yvmnh, pob vavxv ryscae mifh potbe dbcejh ywizt.
* Wfpavs wkqpjuugkf to xou bma dbcejh in smxapjtauqgdk.
* Rsnyj or kdllm sis fcqz lmuccwhd mifh ssbfvk xou bma dbcejh.

Bgfcn tot've upai jgy bwpia phfgt, pob ifc tkmanvo xou `bype` dbcejh fdupvayq kzbw as xou `qgfrbi` dbcejh, tot teq mxuepy xou `qgfrbi` dbcejh:

[source, console]
----
$ ckw hmir lcjavc --delete qgfrbi
----
